  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 11.0.0.1:\n- Target framework `net11.0` and MAUI 11\n- Runtime patching on .NET 11\n- Package validation\n- The stub scan\n- WebAuthenticator\n- dotnet/maui's MAUI 11 device tests run against OpenMaui\n- Modal pages through MAUI 11's `IModalNavigationPlatform`\n- Maps: `Pin.ShowInfoWindow` and `HideInfoWindow`\n- Keyboard activation of a tappable Border\n- `NavigationPage.BackButtonAccessibilityLabel` and Shell's `BackButtonBehavior.AccessibilityLabel`\n- ToolbarItem badges\n- SwipeItem icons\n- Animations follow the desktop's animations setting while the app runs\n- WebAuthenticator custom URI scheme callbacks\n- Passkeys\n- MAUI 11's own handler registrations were taken for the app's\n- `VisualElement.CaptureAsync` and `Window.CaptureAsync` returned null on MAUI 11\n- Maps ignored the initial `MapSpan`, `Map.Region` and `Map.MoveToRegion` on MAUI 11\n- Tab moved focus to the page beneath an open popup\n- A click on a dimmed popup's backdrop was not a background click\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
